/*
 * Aggregates binary operators related to integer operands.
 *
 * This module groups all binary operators whose semantics involve integer
 * values. Integer-specific operators are organized into dedicated submodules to
 * keep arithmetic, comparison, bitwise, and special-case behaviors clearly
 * separated and consistent with the rest of the binary operator hierarchy.
 *
 * The grouped operator families include:
 *
 *   - bitwise operators(AND, OR, XOR, shifts),
 *   - comparison operators(==, <, >, …),
 *   - arithmetic operators(+, -, *, /, %),
 *   - special integer operators(exp, sqrt, etc.).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::int_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/int_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2025-01-04
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
